# No test runner and no linter: the lock made from this file is what the
# image installs. pytest, pytest-django, pytest-cov, black, isort, flake8,
# pre-commit, mypy and django-stubs were named here, so the image shipped
# them with everything they bring (#788). The two jobs that run the unit
# tests install pytest and its plugins on top of this lock, pytest-django
# among them (.github/workflows/test.yml), at the versions
# tests/ci-tools/requirements.in gives; the Code Quality job installs the
# linters from that lock. To run the tests by hand, see the README.
